This file used to be the ModuCPP front-end for ANIX. ModuCPP was removed in Abora OS 4.2.

It stays as an empty placeholder because the updater already installed on Abora 4.0 and 4.1 refuses to
update to a release that doesn't contain it. It will be deleted in a later release, once nobody updates
from those versions. See scripts/release/legacy-required-paths.txt.
